                    "That is the mechanism, and it is a very ordinary one once you say it out loud.  A big channel on a living-room television is something a family puts on.  Two or three people are present, the thing is running, somebody is on a phone.  A small specialist channel is something one person chose and sat down for.  TVision's own chart labels for the two ends, as Net Influencer quotes them, are \"solo fans, intentional viewing\" and \"group viewing, background noise\".",
